<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Academic Program Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Undergraduate Programs Office and Advising Center</h2>
      <p><span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address_line_2">{{ address_line_2 }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p>RBB 328</p>
      <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p>FAX: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
      <p>E-mail: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
      <p>Website: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">B.S. DEGREE IN ACCOUNTING</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">2020-2021</h2>

  <div class="section-title">Admission Requirements for the Accounting Major:</div>
  <p>The Accounting major is a limited access program. To be admitted to the major, students must (1) have completed at least <span data-field="min_semesters_required">{{ min_semesters_required }}</span> semesters, (2) have completed ACG 2021, ACG 2071, CGS 2100 or CGS 2518, ECO 2013, ECO 2023, MAC 2233, and STA 2023 with a grade of "C-" or better in each course, and (3) have the required overall GPA on all prior college coursework which is at least in effect at the time they enter the major. Note: Students must have a "B-" or better in ACG 2021 and ACG 2071 to enroll in any upper-level Accounting course. The overall GPA required for the 2020 - 2021 academic year (Fall 2020, Spring 2021, and Summer 2021) is 2.90. The overall GPA required is subject to change each academic year.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Lower-level Prerequisites for Accounting Majors: All of these courses must be completed with a "C-" or better prior to admission to the Accounting major.</div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course #</th>
        <th>Course Title</th>
        <th>Hrs</th>
        <th>Course Prerequisites</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in lower_level_prerequisites %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ item.course_code }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.course_title }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.hours }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.prerequisites }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">CGS 2518 - Spreadsheets for Business (prerequisite to ACG4401; see below)</div>
  <p>This course also counts as a non-business course. It is a prerequisite to ACG4401.</p>

  <div class="section-title">GEB 1030 - Professional Development for Business Careers (1) is required for all students entering FSU Fall 2019 or later. A grade of "C-" or better is required.</div>

  <div class="section-title">RMI 2302 - Risk in Business and Society (3) is required for students entering FSU 2013 or later. A grade of "C-" or better is required.</div>

  <div class="section-title">General Business Core Requirements for Accounting Majors: Students must earn a "C-" or better in each course.</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>FIN</th>
        <th>3403</th>
        <th>Financial Management of the Firm</th>
        <th>3</th>
        <th>ECO 2023, ACG 2021</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>CGS</th>
        <th>3213</th>
        <th>Business Communications</th>
        <th>3</th>
        <th>Admission to the major</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>ISM</th>
        <th>3541</th>
        <th>Introduction to Business Analytics</th>
        <th>3</th>
        <th>None</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>MAN</th>
        <th>3240</th>
        <th>Organizational Behavior</th>
        <th>3</th>
        <th>None</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>MAR</th>
        <th>3023</th>
        <th>Basic Marketing Concepts</th>
        <th>3</th>
        <th>None</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in general_business_core_requirements %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ item.code }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.number }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.title }}</td>
