  </table>

  <div class="section-title">General Business Breadth Requirements for Accounting Majors: Students must earn a "C-" or better in each course.</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>FIN</th>
        <th>3244</th>
        <th>Financial Markets, Institutions, and Intl. Finance Systems</th>
        <th>3</th>
